<title>USA: Hamburg Twp., Mich., won by First of Michigan.</title>
<headline>Hamburg Twp., Mich., won by First of Michigan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of Michigan said it won $5.225 million of Hamburg Twp., Mich., wastewater treatment plant revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.6413 percent.</p>
</text>
